{
  "description": "The import of a fork Config file (SDN-27, #203): the Virtual Hub LAB of tests/golden/configimport/sample.config is the VRF lab with one Network, its users are Users whose groups are the tags of their Nodes, and its access list is the Policies of lab in the order of the fork, with a last Policy that lets through what no entry matches. The packets are frames that tests/golden/policyimport records for the fork on the same hub: those that the fork let through are delivered, those that it dropped are dropped by the rule that stands for the entry, and the three named narrower are ones that the fork let through and the import drops, because the entry that let them through has a match that a Policy lacks (the MAC address of entry 5, the redirect of entry 11) or the entry that would not match them has one (the source port of entry 9). The import carries such an entry as a deny rule and says so, so it never lets through what the fork dropped.",
